, the narrator takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yXVr__3LGZcQ7kNvwFYFXie&_nc_oc=Adpo-KvbgvavWErJTVkRUV9AKR9E2hceTxGT-tqtxhOLusLI8685jlZRL8WLLa2SPWY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGONFoJNobG5PCcFfWx9yOlexqu4LZRVEr09lA7JEhr_A&oe=6A859101"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0jagG1L0O-EQ7kNvwFLujXt&_nc_oc=Adr44CBIAT9_YCPFQpm_dX1_YFXrXubpXwDHx0-3x3t16Atgs5so3R2TIIFyPEaqfaA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH2-wT8owe_9VszxtJOkqVQJELrMJAq_wIP2mSUS288tw&oe=6A859E66"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z-drlBrGN4QQ7kNvwHWc-ZG&_nc_oc=Ado0a28hMn-VrRFooLO9LdCPXqd0Om3BgWfI0-h-QC2Zzj0pFgPfolKnjLKiy4HMsEw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGDhSTjKwy4PCoRUDPdL